fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gsttaglist.html#gst_tag_list_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_tag_list_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.TagList.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.TagList.is_writable\n\nTests if you can safely modify taglist. It is only safe to modify taglist when\nthere is only one owner of the taglist - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na GstTagList\nTests if you can safely modify taglist. It is only safe to modify taglist when\nthere is only one owner of the taglist - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.TagList\nTests if you can safely modify taglist. It is only safe to modify taglist when\nthere is only one owner of the taglist - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.TagList\n"});